Subject: [PATCH] MTU size fix in feeds

---
 .../patches/0001-MTU-fix-in-build.patch       | 56 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 56 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 net_core/plugins/ip-manager/patches/0001-MTU-fix-in-build.patch

diff --git a/net_core/plugins/ip-manager/patches/0001-MTU-fix-in-build.patch b/net_core/plugins/ip-manager/patches/0001-MTU-fix-in-build.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ffae7f4
--- /dev/null
+++ b/net_core/plugins/ip-manager/patches/0001-MTU-fix-in-build.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@
